    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d675">

                <pb facs="0788" n="728" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg728"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Roosevelt to Mr. Olney</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-06-19"><hi rendition="#italic">June 19,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Home secretary will release John Curtin Kent on “ticket of leave” as soon as
                    friends arrange to care for him.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Roosevelt.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
